4910","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.2.4.2 Patch Notes","summary":"\\Fixed an issue where the frame rate would occasionally drop in certain situations.Fixed an issue where quest completion conditions were not updating properly.\\Consumables can now be used directly from Storage.\\Added Italian, Polish, Turkish, and Thai.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:52:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028243","verified_at":"2026-10-21T12:18:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1846651706691117","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"announcement","title":"Hollowcity Is Joining the October Next Fest!","summary":"Hello, this is the Hollowcity development team.Hollowcity is taking part in Steam Next Fest: October Edition! Schedule: October 19, 10 AM PT – October 26, 10 AM PT (October 20, 2 AM – October 27, 2 AM KST)To celebrate, we've updated the demo to version 0.2.4.1. The biggest change is Xbox controller support. For full details, please check out the patch notes.About Demo Save DataFor stability reasons, demo characters and worlds will not carry over to the full game.Instead, we plan to let you recei","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:34:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691117","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1846651706690193","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.2.4.1 Patch Notes","summary":"\\Gamepad support has been added.Mouse side buttons can now be assigned in key bindings.Developer's Note Gamepad controls may still feel rough in places. If anything feels awkward or you have ideas for improvement, please let us know anytime on the Steam discussion boards or Discord. Your feedback means a lot to us.\\The hideout has been redesigned in preparation for the full release.Unfortunately, no new features are added in the demo. New areas can be unlocked after progressing through the full ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:19:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690193","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1843481262700815","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.2.2 Patch Notes","summary":"\\- Added crouching. Press Ctrl with the default controls to crouch or stand up.- Crouching reduces recoil and bullet spread and speeds up reloading. Movement and dashing are restricted while crouched, and you cannot fire while crouching down or standing up.- Added dedicated reticles for red dot and holographic sights. Enable \"Sight reticles\" in Settings to use them, or leave the option off to keep the existing crosshair.\\- Hunger and thirst meters now drain more slowly.- Sprinting consumes less ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T06:20:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700815","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1842212951303974","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.2.0.1 Hotfix Patch Notes","summary":"\\- Fixed some translations that could be misleading or confusing.\\- Fixed UI text not displaying in some languages.\\- Fixed the shooting range area being detected as larger than its actual boundaries.- Optimized the shooting range HUD. This improves frame drops that occurred while the HUD was displayed at the shooting range.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T17:45:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303974","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1842212951301161","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.2.0 Patch Notes","summary":"\\- Added a unique portrait for each NPC.- NPCs now say different lines depending on the situation.- A notification now appears in the bottom-right corner of the screen when a new quest becomes available. Developer Comment Our original goal was a game with casual gameplay but a somewhat realistic visual style. However, during the demo we found that a very large share of our players are from Asia, and we received a lot of feedback asking for NPC portraits. So we've added anime-style portraits to s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T19:57:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951301161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1837955055364085","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"announcement","title":"The Official Demo for HollowCity: Escape From Seoul is Now Live!","summary":"Hello! The official demo for 'HollowCity: Escape From Seoul' is finally out.Our game aims to be a PvE extraction shooter with a relatively casual charm. We've prepared various difficulty options to satisfy everyone, from those who want a lighthearted experience to those who prefer a hardcore challenge.🎮 Single & Co-op Multiplayer We support both single-player and up to 4-player co-op multiplayer.⚠️ Please note that multiplayer is currently available only with your friends on Steam!As this is our","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T17:53:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1836506165556874","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Conclusion & Upcoming Demo Schedule","summary":"Hello, Survivors! This is the developer of HollowCity: Escape from Seoul. First, I would like to express my heartfelt gratitude to all the survivors who participated in our first playtest and shared their valuable feedback. Based on your insights, I am doing my absolute best to improve the game and create a more immersive and enjoyable gameplay environment. Next, I would like to share the schedule for the conclusion of the first playtest, the upcoming second playtest, and the official demo relea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T17:26:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165556874","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1835236783569291","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"announcement","title":"1st Playtest Schedule Announcement","summary":"Hello, everyone. This is the developer of HollowCity: Escape from Seoul. I am excited to share the news about our very first playtest.\\Start Time: June 18, 2026, at 7:00 PM (KST)Duration: Approximately 10 days\\ The top priority of this playtest is to ensure system stability and identify bug fixes ahead of our upcoming official demo release.\\ Please note that detailed balancing has not yet been applied to the current build. As a result, you may find many shortcomings in terms of balance, such as ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T07:15:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783569291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4434910-1826362059932235","game_id":"steam-4434910","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Co-op Multiplayer Support Confirmed","summary":"Hello everyone, this is StudioHeorang.We have been carefully listening to your feedback across our various community channels. Among the many suggestions, the most requested feature for our PvE Extraction Shooter was, without a doubt, the ability to survive and escape together with friends.Today, we are excited to announce that we have officially decided to implement a Co-op Multiplayer Mode!This update is being built on the Steam Networking (SDR) infrastructure. By utilizing Steam’s dedicated r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-10T08:27:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059932235","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4434910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4434910":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4434910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z"},"4881740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:29Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4434910","app_id":4434910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok"